  "description": "<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"370\"><strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"370\">Snelle en professionele laptop met sterke prestaties, Windows 11 en duurzaam ontwerp – In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"711\">De <strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"396\">HP ProBook 440 G5</strong> is een ideale keuze voor werk, studie en dagelijks gebruik. Dankzij de <strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"491\">Intel Core i5-8250U</strong>, <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"515\">16GB DDR4-geheugen</strong> en een <strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"536\">128GB SSD</strong> werkt de laptop snel, soepel en betrouwbaar. Het compacte 14-inch formaat maakt hem prettig om mee te nemen, terwijl het heldere Full HD-scherm zorgt voor comfortabel werken.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"812\">Deze laptop wordt geleverd met <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"758\">Windows 11</strong> en een <strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"777\">oplader</strong>, zodat je direct aan de slag kunt.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"862\"><strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"862\">Waarom deze ProBook een uitstekende keuze is</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<li data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"916\">⚡ Krachtige prestaties door i5-8250U en 16GB RAM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"953\">🚀 Snelle opstart dankzij de SSD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"991\">🖥️ Helder 14-inch Full HD-scherm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1046\">💼 Zakelijke bouwkwaliteit met strakke uitstraling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1071\">🔌 Inclusief oplader</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1092\">✨ In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1123\">📋 <strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1123\">Specificaties</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<th data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eigenschap</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1180\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CPU</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Intel Core i5-8250U</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1210\" data-col-size=\"sm\">RAM</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1223\">16GB DDR4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1233\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Opslag</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1246\">128GB SSD</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Scherm</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1288\">14 inch, 1920×1080 (Full HD)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OS</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1308\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Windows 11</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1326\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Connectiviteit</td>\r\n<td data-co